# The Iron Graveyard's staked wreck (CIPlay iron_graveyard_spikes, 11-12 w09; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in
# the recipe: the stranded boat at 66.5 2, a ring of scrap stakes round it (zones ig_spike0-11 on a 7 x 13 m ellipse,
# r 2.8, spikes, safe=none; ig_spike6 at 66.5 -11), the sign at 61 -16, the wreckers' chest at 66.5 10.8.
island The Iron Graveyard keep
offset 0.5278 -0.359
hour 11
weather Calm
empty
picture ig_stakes 58 +3 -24 66.5 +1 -4
at 62 -17.5
wait 2
read STAKED - KEEP OFF
where igspike
walk 62 -17.5 to 66.5 -18 to 66.5 -12.4
wait 6
expect message Scrap stakes
expect hurt 4
at 66.5 -21
wait 4
expect unhurt
open Wreckers' chest
wait 2
expect item CircuitBoard 1
